                        <p data-i18n="home_cqa_body">The Center for Quality Assurance (CQA) leads CSPC's institutional efforts to uphold service excellence, monitor compliance with quality standards, and drive continuous improvement across all academic and administrative units — ensuring that the services delivered to students, employees, and the public consistently meet the highest standards of efficiency, transparency, and accountability.</p>
