                        <p data-i18n="home_csm_body">The Client Satisfaction Measurement (CSM) is a short, standardized survey you complete right after availing a government service. It captures how satisfied you were with the transaction and helps CSPC identify which offices and services need improvement — supporting the College's compliance with the Ease of Doing Business and Efficient Government Service Delivery Act (Republic Act No. 11032).</p>
